    "https://careers.utoledo.edu/jobs/radiation-therapist-temporary-health-science-campus-hospital-toledo-oh-ohio-united-states-488e2006-0787-41e9-b633-998a657347b8": {
      "title": "UToledo Careers",
      "description": "Radiation Therapist - Temporary - Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Back to UToledo Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Radiation Therapist - Temporary 501467 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH Healthcare Positions None Part-Time Staff - Temporary Add to favorites View favorites Title: Radiation Therapist - Temporary Department Org: Radiation Therapy-Univ Med Ctr - 109170 Employee Classification: N4 - Unclass Temp HSC Bargaining Unit: Professional Staff Association Primary Location: HSC H Shift: 1 Start Time: End Time: Posted Salary: Float: False Rotate: False On Call: False Travel: False Weekend/Holiday: True Job Description: Under the general supervision of the Technical Manager, the staff radiation oncology therapist applies ionizing radiation to the patient in accordance with the prescription and instructions of the Radiation Oncologist and under the guidelines set forth by the clinical physicist. Minimum Qualifications: Must have a high school diploma or equivalent; satisfactorily completion of formal radiologic technology training majoring in radiation therapy in an accredited school and meets the requirements for registry by the ARRT. Must hold current license as required by State of Ohio Department of Health. Must provide documentation of continuing education required by the ARRT to ensure high competence level. Required to be CPR certified. Preferred Qualifications: Must have a high school diploma or equivalent; satisfactorily completion of formal radiologic technology training majoring in radiation therapy in an accredited school and meets the requirements for registry by the ARRT. Must hold current license as required by State of Ohio Department of Health. Must provide documentation of continuing education required by the ARRT to ensure high competence level. Required to be CPR certified. Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, the University of Toledo campuses are tobacco-free. Pre-employment health screening requirements for the University of Toledo Health Science Campus Medical Center will include drug and other required health screenings for the position. Equal Employment Opportunity Statement: The University of Toledo is an equal opportunity employer. The University of Toledo does not discriminate in employment, educational programs, or activities on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, ancestry, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity and expression, military or veteran status, disability, familial status, or political affiliation. The University is dedicated to attracting and retaining the best and brightest talent and fostering a culture of respect. The University of Toledo provides reasonable accommodation to individuals with disabilities. If you require accommodation to complete this application, or for testing or interviewing, please contact HR Compliance at hrcompliance@utoledo.edu or 419-530-4747 between the hours of 8:30 a.m. and 5 p.m. or apply online for an accommodation request. Computer access is available at most public libraries and at the Office of Human Resources located in the Center for Administrative Support on the UToledo Main Campus. Back to job listing Apply Now First Name (required) b7e415df Last Name (required) 7790789b Email (required) b4278d36 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Recommended jobs Cardiac Sonographer 2 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio Heart Station - 109070 Cardiac Sonographer 2, Full Time (8:00am - 17:30pm) 5 8's Saturday rotation\nNo Sundays, Call is on rotation, Holiday call is on rotation.\nMay Underfill with Cardiac Sonographer 1. Ekg Technician I Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio Heart Station - 109070 EKG Technician I, Part Time, Sunday - Saturday (6:30am - 11:00pm).\nRotate, Weekends/Holidays. Assistant/Associate/Full Professor Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH, Ohio. Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio. Health Science Campus Support Toledo, OH, Ohio Dept. of Cell and Cancer Biology - 107500 Cell & Cancer Biology Faculty Position Sign up for job alerts Job Alert 715122b7 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Healthcare Positions None Part-Time Healthcare Positions None Part-Time Employment Type Staff - Temporary Staff - Temporary Locations Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States First Name (required) 9f8fb95d Last Name (required) d405057c Email (required) b53ac17e Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you ↑ Facebook Instagram Tiktok X Youtube © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO • 2801 W. Bancroft St. • Toledo, OH 43606 • 800.586.5336 A - Z List | Careers | Report a Concern | Nondiscrimination | Accessibility | Web Privacy | Feedback | Contact Us | Cookie Preferences Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all Please choose the location(s)"
