 Student Affairs Toledo, OH (4 items) 4 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me Patient Registration Specialist - Staffing Pool Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH Registration - 108820 Full-Time Healthcare Positions Staff - Full-Time Opening on: Oct 4 2024 Thank you for your interest in Registration at UTMC. We are looking to grow our Registration team and are hiring full-time and part-time positions on all shifts. Read more Radiation Therapist 1 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH Radiation Therapy-Univ Med Ctr - 109170 AFSCME Healthcare Positions Staff - Contingent Opening on: Nov 20 2025 Contingent, 1st shift Read more Chair and Professor, Department of Obstetrics & Gynecology Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH Obstetrics and Gynecology - 107600 Academic Administration Faculty Full-Time Healthcare Positions None Show More Show Less Faculty - Regular Opening on: Aug 25 2025 The University of Toledo College of Medicine and Health Sciences seeks a dynamic, collaborative academic physician leader who is passionate about advancing women's health, to serve as its next Chair for the Department of Obstetrics & Gynecology (OB/GYN). This is an exceptional opportunity for a nationally distinguished leader with a strong track record of clinical, teaching, and administrative achievements to lead the department into the future. The next chair will be an inspirational leader who is well versed in the academic missions to serve within a mission-driven department and organization. The successful candidate will also hold the Rita T. Sheely Endowed Chair in Obstetrics and Gynecology.\nThe Department is educationally driven, hosting 19 residents and integral to medical student education. The department employs five full-time faculty through UToledo Physicians, and has approximately 40 affiliated community faculty. UToledo and ProMedica have extended an Academic Affiliation Agreement that will support medical education in the greater Toledo community for the next decade. Through this agreement, ProMedica will continue to provide financial support for the academic mission of the UToledo College of Medicine and Life Sciences. As a result, the next chair of OB/GYN will have an opportunity to lead a robust integrated Department through the recruitment of new faculty, and through partnership and collaboration with existing ProMedica employed physicians. Read more Displaying 181 - 183 of 183 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › Powered by PageUp ↑ Facebook Instagram Tiktok X Youtube © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO • 2801 W. Bancroft St. • Toledo, OH 43606 • 800.586.5336 A - Z List | Careers | Report a Concern | Nondiscrimination | Accessibility | Web Privacy | Feedback | Contact Us | Cookie Preferences Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all"
