    "https://careers.utoledo.edu/jobs/temporary-researcher-main-campus-academic-toledo-oh-ohio-united-states": {
      "title": "Temporary Researcher",
      "description": "Temporary Researcher - Main Campus - Academic Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Back to UToledo Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Temporary Researcher 501482 Main Campus - Academic Toledo, OH Academic None Part-Time Research Support Services Show More Show Less Staff - Temporary Add to favorites View favorites Title: Temporary Researcher Department Org: MIME - 102010 Employee Classification: H6 - Intermittent - Seasonal Hourly Bargaining Unit: Bargaining Unit Exempt Primary Location: MC AC Shift: 1 Start Time: End Time: Posted Salary: 20.00 Float: {bOther1} Rotate: {bOther2} On Call: {bOther3} Travel: {bOther4} Weekend/Holiday: {bOther5} Job Description: The Part-Time Temporary Research Associate will support ongoing research activities in the Elahinia Research Group within the Department of MIME. The position will contribute to research projects involving advanced materials, additive manufacturing, shape memory alloys, smart materials, and related experimental and computational research activities. The employee will assist with the planning, execution, analysis, and documentation of research activities and provide technical support to ongoing research projects. Minimum Qualifications: • Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering, Materials Science and Engineering, or a closely related field. • Demonstrated research experience in additive manufacturing, shape memory alloys, advanced materials, smart materials, or related engineering fields. • Experience with experimental design, materials characterization, data analysis, and technical report or manuscript preparation. Preferred Qualifications: • Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a multidisciplinary research environment Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, the University of Toledo campuses are tobacco-free. Pre-employment health screening requirements for the University of Toledo Health Science Campus Medical Center will include drug and other required health screenings for the position. Equal Employment Opportunity Statement: The University of Toledo is an equal opportunity employer. The University of Toledo does not discriminate in employment, educational programs, or activities on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, ancestry, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity and expression, military or veteran status, disability, familial status, or political affiliation. The University is dedicated to attracting and retaining the best and brightest talent and fostering a culture of respect. The University of Toledo provides reasonable accommodation to individuals with disabilities. If you require accommodation to complete this application, or for testing or interviewing, please contact HR Compliance at hrcompliance@utoledo.edu or 419-530-4747 between the hours of 8:30 a.m. and 5 p.m. or apply online for an accommodation request. Computer access is available at most public libraries and at the Office of Human Resources located in the Center for Administrative Support on the UToledo Main Campus. Back to job listing Apply Now First Name (required) 3fb418ee Last Name (required) 1dc43276 Email (required) 63f23752 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Recommended jobs Food Service Worker Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio Food And Nutritional Svcs - 109760 Prepare and mixes ingredients for cold dishes and beverages. Make toast, prepares short order foods on grill and fried foods. Assembles food for patients and serves employees, visitors, and students. Delivers patient trays to bedside Server Administrator Main Campus - Administration Toledo, OH, Ohio IT Personnel - 105780 This position is responsible for the server administration and daily server operations of The University of Toledo’s server infrastructure including upgrades, installation, and troubleshooting of server related hardware, software, and applications. Th