      "title": "Custodial Worker",
      "description": "Custodial Worker - Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Back to UToledo Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Custodial Worker 501462 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH AFSCME Custodial Workers Full-Time Maintenance/Facilities Support Services Show More Show Less Staff - Full-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: Custodial Worker Department Org: Environmental Services - 108990 Employee Classification: B1 - Classif'd Full Time AFSCME HSC Bargaining Unit: AFSCME HSC Primary Location: HSC H Shift: 1 Start Time: 8:00am End Time: 4:30pm Posted Salary: 17.23 Float: True Rotate: True On Call: False Travel: False Weekend/Holiday: True Job Description: Cleans and services patient, public, clinical, academic and administrative areas as directed by management. Executes tasks and assignments in a thorough, professional manner to assure a clean, attractive, safe environment with minimal interference to others. Minimum Qualifications: Minimum Education/Training: High school diploma or equivalent or custodial experience. Able to read, understand, and follow written instructions, and comprehend verbal instructions given in English. Minimum Work Experience: None required. Minimal related experience is desirable. Age-Specific Competency: Able to differentiate and appropriately handle situations involving patients, visitors, and family members in various age groups. Physical Effort Required: Able to stand for long periods, stoop, kneel and reach with no restrictions. Able to use a 16- or 24-ounce wet mop for extended periods. Ability to lift, carry and maneuver objects weighing up to 50 lbs. Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, the University of Toledo campuses are tobacco-free. Pre-employment health screening requirements for the University of Toledo Health Science Campus Medical Center will include drug and other required health screenings for the position. Equal