t scheduling, pre-registration and insurance verification for non-invasive, routine care services. Sign up for job alerts Job Alert 56bc6304 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories AFSCME Food Service Full-Time Support Services AFSCME Food Service Full-Time Support Services Employment Type Staff - Full-Time Staff - Full-Time Locations Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States First Name (required) 896c66a5 Last Name (required) 0d9366ce Email (required) af0b7eca Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you ↑ Facebook Instagram Tiktok X Youtube © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO • 2801 W. Bancroft St. • Toledo, OH 43606 • 800.586.5336 A - Z List | Careers | Report a Concern | Nondiscrimination | Accessibility | Web Privacy | Feedback | Contact Us | Cookie Preferences Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all Please choose the location(s)"
